tinysun contains a private namespaced subset of ERFA (NumFOCUS Foundation),
https://github.com/liberfa/erfa commit 1a8044cde5b7763295d472a6443387239127c6c8.
ERFA is derived with permission from IAU SOFA. The original BSD-style license
is retained in ERFA-LICENSE.txt and in each adapted source file.
TinyNadir changes: private symbol prefixes and const-qualified coefficient
pointer tables in epv00; public wrapper is separate. The pointer-table change
does not alter the numerical model or its coefficient values.
No claim is made that this is an unmodified ERFA/SOFA distribution.
